<title>USA: Newmont says unwound 1.1 mln oz gold hedge.</title>
<headline>Newmont says unwound 1.1 mln oz gold hedge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newmont Gold Company  said it has purchased about 1.1 million ounces of gold to offset the hedge position it acquired in the merger with Santa Fe Pacific Gold Corp.</p>
<p>Newmont will realize a gain of about $100 million on the transaction.</p>
</text>
